{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon! Long time no talk! Last week, I built a new website for customers to make orders. It's been a wild ride but I'm loving it. What's up with you? How's the dance studio?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-9665eeb616a68c72deda17fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:06.257455+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9665eeb616a68c72deda17fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9665eeb616a68c72deda17fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina, congrats on the clothing store! The dance studio is on tenuous grounds right now, but I'm staying positive. I got a temp job to help cover expenses while I look for investors. It's tough, but I'm sure it'll be worth it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-b7bf8b4e1612b3d331ebf967", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:10.382561+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b7bf8b4e1612b3d331ebf967", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b7bf8b4e1612b3d331ebf967", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks, Jon! Appreciate the kind words. Sorry to hear about the studio, but glad to see the positivity. Not easy facing setbacks but I believe in you. Finding investors can be tough, but you've got the passion and experience to make it happen. Rome wasn't built in a day so keep pushing on!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-0fbf0aa8fa8b7a3b2b50d8ac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:14.510354+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0fbf0aa8fa8b7a3b2b50d8ac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0fbf0aa8fa8b7a3b2b50d8ac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks for the support. Running a business isn't easy, but I'm determined to make it work. How have you tackled challenges in your business? Got any advice?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-75de58b411de8b96ad6cae27", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:18.634509+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "75de58b411de8b96ad6cae27", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "75de58b411de8b96ad6cae27", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: I've had some tough times with my business, Jon. Sourcing trendy pieces for my store was a big hurdle. I had to do a lot of research and networking. My advice? Don't be scared to reach out to people in your field for help and contacts. Networking was a lifesaver for me and opened me up to amazing products that I might not have found otherwise."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-cc6e136e8b21ba62e6af8e06", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:22.776231+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cc6e136e8b21ba62e6af8e06", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cc6e136e8b21ba62e6af8e06", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Awesome advice! Lately I've been networking and it's gotten me some good stuff. Really can't beat what connections can do. Check this pic I got from the last networking event!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-abe1f28ea3762567393d4554", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:26.869727+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "abe1f28ea3762567393d4554", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "abe1f28ea3762567393d4554", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Nice one, Jon! Networking really pays off. Connecting with like-minded people is key. How was the event?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-26a543aa7fd6b197f1ad2379", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:30.995844+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "26a543aa7fd6b197f1ad2379", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "26a543aa7fd6b197f1ad2379", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! The event was awesome. I met some investors and got some good advice. The energy was really motivating, it gave me a boost to go after my goals."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-41f2f6e0ff3820de463c049d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:35.121983+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "41f2f6e0ff3820de463c049d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "41f2f6e0ff3820de463c049d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow, Jon! Congrats on the successful night! What are your plans now with the advice you got?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-f2bfd09d6852bb4e9cbe1a03", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:39.228164+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f2bfd09d6852bb4e9cbe1a03", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f2bfd09d6852bb4e9cbe1a03", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Taking your advice, I'm sprucing up my biz plan and tweaking my pitch to investors. I'm also working on an online platform to show off the dance studio's stuff."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-1ffe6931fc09f4f400d1579b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:43.361858+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ffe6931fc09f4f400d1579b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ffe6931fc09f4f400d1579b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Sounds like a great plan, Jon! An online platform can really show off your studio and get investors. Need help with anything?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-fa80e39ddd6864c829eeccc4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:47.506572+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fa80e39ddd6864c829eeccc4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fa80e39ddd6864c829eeccc4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! Appreciate the offer. Need help with marketing strategies - any advice on reaching my target audience and raising awareness for the dance studio?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-86a0d1095a4248b12669a854", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:51.620570+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "86a0d1095a4248b12669a854", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "86a0d1095a4248b12669a854", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Yeah Jon, marketing is key for getting your dance studio noticed. Instagram and TikTok can help you reach a younger crowd. Posting dance clips or content related to dance can help. You could also collaborate with local influencers or dance communities. I could help you with making content or even managing your accounts if you want."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-337088bd8f6a313966fa5fae", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:55.745377+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "337088bd8f6a313966fa5fae", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "337088bd8f6a313966fa5fae", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Sounds great. I'd really appreciate your help with making content and managing my social media. Let's get together and make the dance studio look awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-2db123303ca41a3dedc1eccb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:24:59.852744+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2db123303ca41a3dedc1eccb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2db123303ca41a3dedc1eccb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Let's create some cool content and manage your social media accounts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-c4eeefa94ca7fbe836bce5fd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:25:03.951374+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c4eeefa94ca7fbe836bce5fd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c4eeefa94ca7fbe836bce5fd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks for the support. You rock!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-8d5bff0cfd493cc3987df4ba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:25:08.104872+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8d5bff0cfd493cc3987df4ba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8d5bff0cfd493cc3987df4ba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Thanks, Jon! You're awesome. Let's get to work and make your studio shine!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-865b0984a3f4365505cdf7a4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:25:12.228806+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "865b0984a3f4365505cdf7a4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "865b0984a3f4365505cdf7a4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Definitely, Gina! Let's make our collaboration awesome and bring some dance magic to the world. Can't wait to see what we can do together!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-0845d2fee777ef4394b8b543", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:25:16.365121+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0845d2fee777ef4394b8b543", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0845d2fee777ef4394b8b543", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Definitely, Jon! I'm pumped to collaborate with you and make some sweet moves. Together, we can make a difference and show the world what we can do. Let's go for it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_18-3fa0f7643d050c588ef8b4ca", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:25:20.482283+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3fa0f7643d050c588ef8b4ca", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3fa0f7643d050c588ef8b4ca", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
